    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357">

                <pb facs="0405" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">638.6531/12: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Woodward</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-21T17:00:00-04:00">September 21, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>79. Your 100, September 14, 2 p.m. Your actions approved. However, you should
                    make it perfectly clear that this Government expects any reduction on any
                    Italian product to be extended to the like product of the United States.<anchor
                        n="51" xml:id="d357-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d357-f1" n="51" xml:id="d357-f1-content">
                <p>However, the negotiations did not result in the signature of a commercial
                    arrangement between Haiti and Italy at this time.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
